, "message": "monthly average", "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:36:47Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a94c785a6738777df884d6a6331d1843dc1906b1", "message": "remove extra summary columns", "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:30:07Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "56bb2e551b3d5ab298df5a25d6af9cb3fedc2bf5", "message": "parse cc date from statement", "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:18:14Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "65bed3c8316272da582602178a78cd512bf2e0a0", "message": "parsing tests", "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:00:48Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0d9d99a7db5057ff9e4835d2a6670be2d29e339d", "message": "fixes", "created_at": "2026-01-21T17:15:42Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4c3589600594e33e524410bef8813539cd25ac49", "message": "single sheet with formulas", "created_at": "2026-01-21T17:08:57Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7450686f445bffc84e0edfde74e1333265754548", "message": "add other party to description", "created_at": "2026-01-21T15:27:28Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5ea8090c5231cef00a2d1dee90bc3e5edbe5957e", "message": "Fix enrichment output and filter detail sheets\n\n- Filter out detail sources (used only for enrichment) from output\n- Add enriched_from field to output Excel sheets to track enrichment source\n- Add enriched_from to NormalizedTransaction model\n- Pass enriched_from through categorizer to normalized output\n- Update test expectations for new Enriched From column\n\nThis prevents detail sheets (transfers_out, checks_deposit) from appearing\nin the normalized output and shows users which transactions were enriched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-21T14:30:50Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "48888ccbf204cbf478fbff3f31031fab05255908", "message": "Simplify Excel sheet names to use filenames only\n\nRemove folder path information from sheet names, using only the filename.\nThis makes sheet names cleaner and more readable (e.g., FibiSave1752242715177_.xls\ninstead of FIBI.FibiSave1752242715177_.xls). Still respects Excel's 31 character\nlimit by truncating if needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-21T14:23:51Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9627b3d8714bb81427c3c94d23098ed5863e0071", "message": "Implement transaction enrichment system\n\nAdd configuration-driven enrichment to merge transaction details from\nmultiple data sources. Main features:\n\n- New TransactionEnricher class that matches transactions by date + amount\n- Enrichment rules configured in sources.yaml (main/detail sources, match keys)\n- Transaction descriptions enriched via field concatenation with \" | \" separator\n- Added enriched_from field to track which source enriched each transaction\n- Updated CLI to three-pass processing: parse \u2192 enrich \u2192 categorize\n- Comprehensive test coverage with 4 new tests\n- Updated Transaction and Config models with enrichment support\n- Sample configuration with example enrichment rules for check deposits\n  and transfer details\n\nThis enables users to join detailed transaction information from separate\nfiles (e.g., transfers_out with check account numbers) into main account\ntransactions for better visibility in the normalized output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-21T14:16:20Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "63db22edb16a6ed215a752dc2ac213f697d1322c", "message": "rule direction", "created_at": "2026-01-21T12:41:32Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "48fe159aa03c318a2b8d6ac46f3cfc5c9a056f52", "message": "fix error sum", "created_at": "2026-01-21T12:23:59Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "07bd7cee5f951fd13ee2402d0570d070320c151e", "message": "number format", "created_at": "2026-01-21T12:07:23Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ec58c1e2d2a54d0cca956b17ac18d2789df42f5", "message": "Add error amounts", "created_at": "2026-01-21T11:44:33Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0b77a3d71e9462d6321be8d2f045767fe8126f94", "message": "unit commands", "created_at": "2026-01-21T08:07:41Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff56bd77d462b6c08cf8bf269bdc6995bbe297db", "message": "rounding currency", "created_at": "2026-01-21T07:02:19Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c28bf42f885f6633cbb4fb959428b032ed8f6d15", "message": "currency type fix", "created_at": "2026-01-21T06:49:25Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9e91995d6212b515d5de76b9dfb239142d79c938", "message": "Remove category from normalized data", "created_at": "2026-01-21T06:31:01Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8db3e32162403cd308deceed74c08e0a54c18e66", "message": "fix sum total", "created_at": "2026-01-20T21:50:39Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": nu