: "2026-01-20T18:46:35Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "71ffaf8c026a5aef8acfe5fbb1aab5da9035e356", "message": "config", "created_at": "2026-01-20T18:39:02Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4420218b9b79d8c6884ceffc2b201eb241a98038", "message": "Add example configuration files with comprehensive categorization rules\n\nAdded complete example configuration to help new users get started:\n- categories.yaml: 11 spending categories with 40+ subcategories\n- rules.yaml: 50+ pattern-matching rules for automatic categorization (Hebrew & English)\n- currencies.yaml: Exchange rate configuration for NIS, USD, EUR\n- sources.yaml: Data source configurations for various Israeli banks\n\nThe rules include patterns for:\n- Income (salary, interest)\n- Food (groceries, restaurants, coffee, delivery)\n- Transportation (fuel, transit, parking, tolls, maintenance)\n- Housing (utilities, insurance, professional services)\n- Entertainment (streaming, movies, sports, shopping)\n- Healthcare (pharmacy, doctor, dental, vision)\n- Vacation (flights, hotels, activities)\n- Education (tuition, classes)\n- Charity and events\n- Skip categories (transfers, investments, savings)\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-20T18:35:14Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "98b3e647d9367bc796943382ff898908ce06d80f", "message": "remove source column", "created_at": "2026-01-20T17:46:57Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f30b99d8c8c3566c4cf02fe099c9379a6cb86853", "message": "README.md", "created_at": "2026-01-20T17:44:24Z", "repo": "spendcrunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha